{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And of all that You give me.</b> Midrash: Jacob instituted the giving of a tithe from property. And we say in Bereshit Rabbah: A certain heretic asked Rabbi Yehoshua ben Levi, 'Where do we find that he tithed his sons?' He said to him, 'Levi, whom he consecrated to Heaven.' He said to him, 'But what did he see to consecrate Levi, when he was not the tenth?' He said to him, 'Because Jacob made all his sons like lambs entering the fold to be tithed, and he brought them in by order of their lineage, etc.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:06:16.039133374Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}